0.70 0.70 0.70 RG 0.70 w 56.00 644.49 m 539.28 644.49 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 622.49 Td (RustFund is a Solana/Anchor crowdfunding program that lets contributors fund a campaign toward a goal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 609.09 Td (The review found that the campaign creator can drain all contributed lamports at any time Ч before the goal is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 595.69 Td (reached and without contributor consent Ч because the withdrawal path enforces no goal or deadline check) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 582.29 Td (and moves funds by manipulating account lamports directly. The program also keeps no per-contributor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 568.89 Td (record, so refunds are impossible if a campaign fails. Combined, these issues place all contributed funds at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 555.49 Td (immediate risk. Remediation requires goal/deadline enforcement, per-contributor accounting, and a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 542.09 Td (checks-effects-interactions ordering around any transfer.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 512.69 Td (Recommended Fix Order) Tj ET
0.70 0.70 0.70 RG 0.70 w 56.00 512.69 m 539.28 512.69 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 490.69 Td (1. [Critical] Missing Goal/Deadline Enforcement Enables Fund Drain via Direct Lamport Manipulation ->) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 71 477.29 Td (Fix immediately \(24-48h\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 460.89 Td (2. [Critical] Missing Per-Contributor Accounting -> Fix immediately \(24-48h\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 444.49 Td (3. [Medium] Checks-Effects-Interactions Violation Around Transfer -> Fix within 1-2 weeks) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 0 0 0 rg 56 415.09 Td (Scope) Tj ET
0.70 0.70 0.70 RG 0.70 w 56.00 415.09 m 539.28 415.09 l S
